</style><div class='beehiiv__body'><p class="paragraph"></p><div class="section"><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://diversifytech.com/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="image__image" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/51c6aa6d-cf42-4557-82aa-0e7620a77714/2.png?t=1789043260"/></a></div><p class="paragraph"><span>Hi! Welcome to Diversify Tech&#39;s Professional Edition. This newsletter is for underrepresented people in tech in the U.S.; </span><span>specifically curated for mid-senior level folks.</span><span> Every Tuesday, we share jobs, events, and other career opportunities.</span></p><p class="paragraph"><b>In this week&#39;s issue,</b><br>💼 <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/company/perpay?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Perpay</a> and I<a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/company/imagine-pediatrics?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">magine Pediatrics</a> are hiring<br>📆 Recently, Professor <a class="link" href="https://bsky.app/profile/ruha9.bsky.social/post/3mxhkfwpmjc2f?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Ruha Benjamin’s keynote was censored</a> at a conference. She is <a class="link" href="https://princeton.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_pf7HHwBHR1-xkvnaTReEgg?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408#/registration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">presenting her talk this Saturday</a>.</p><p class="paragraph"><b>Our newsletter is made possible by readers like you. Help us stay sustainable:</b><br>🙏<span> Make a </span><span><span><a class="link" href="https://buy.stripe.com/8wMeY69dFd765DGfZl?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">one-time</a></span></span><span> or </span><span><span><a class="link" href="https://buy.stripe.com/6oE9DM1Ldd76d68bJ2?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">monthly</a></span></span><span> contribution</span><br>💼<span> </span><span><span><a class="link" href="https://www.diversifytech.com/post-a-job?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Post a job</a></span></span><span> to reach 20K professionals in tech</span><br>📣<span> </span><span><span><a class="link" href="{{rp_referral_hub_url}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Share</a></span></span><span> the newsletter with your friends</span></p><p class="paragraph">Cheers,<br>Veni Kunche</p></div><div class="section"><p class="paragraph"><b>Sponsored by Proton</b></p><h3 class="heading" id="privacyfirst-email-built-for-real-p">Privacy-first email. Built for real protection.</h3><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://go.getproton.me/aff_ad?campaign_id=2576&aff_id=12271&aff_type=ho&aff_sub2=Concept2_Static1&aff_sub3=UHL1IQB4PZ&aff_sub4=Primary&utm_campaign=us-en-2c-mail-gro_dis-g_acq-mofu_free_beehiiv_test&utm_source=beehiiv.com&utm_medium=dis_ad&utm_term=&utm_ads=Concept2_Static1&_bhiiv=opp_66efed5d-877a-4fde-befc-46208eca691f_598ab766&bhcl_id=eff1b73c-dcd3-463e-bc68-0e882c36ae7f_{{subscriber_id}}_{{email_address_id}}" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img class="image__image" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/845dbe8f-8e5e-451e-87db-228463e46c14/02.png?t=1770253648"/></a></div><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://go.getproton.me/aff_ad?campaign_id=2576&aff_id=12271&aff_type=ho&aff_sub2=Concept2_Static1&aff_sub3=UHL1IQB4PZ&aff_sub4=Primary&utm_campaign=us-en-2c-mail-gro_dis-g_acq-mofu_free_beehiiv_test&utm_source=beehiiv.com&utm_medium=dis_ad&utm_term=&utm_ads=Concept2_Static1&_bhiiv=opp_66efed5d-877a-4fde-befc-46208eca691f_598ab766&bhcl_id=eff1b73c-dcd3-463e-bc68-0e882c36ae7f_{{subscriber_id}}_{{email_address_id}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Proton Mail</a> offers what others won’t:</p><ul><li><p class="paragraph">End-to-end encryption by default</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Zero access to your data</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Open-source and independently audited</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Based in Switzerland with strong privacy laws</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Free to start, no ads</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph">We don’t scan your emails. We don’t sell your data. And we don’t make you dig through settings to find basic security. <a class="link" href="https://go.getproton.me/aff_ad?campaign_id=2576&aff_id=12271&aff_type=ho&aff_sub2=Concept2_Static1&aff_sub3=UHL1IQB4PZ&aff_sub4=Primary&utm_campaign=us-en-2c-mail-gro_dis-g_acq-mofu_free_beehiiv_test&utm_source=beehiiv.com&utm_medium=dis_ad&utm_term=&utm_ads=Concept2_Static1&_bhiiv=opp_66efed5d-877a-4fde-befc-46208eca691f_598ab766&bhcl_id=eff1b73c-dcd3-463e-bc68-0e882c36ae7f_{{subscriber_id}}_{{email_address_id}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Proton</a> is built for people who want control, not compromise.</p><p class="paragraph">Simple, secure, and free.</p><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://go.getproton.me/aff_ad?campaign_id=2576&aff_id=12271&aff_type=ho&aff_sub2=Concept2_Static1&aff_sub3=UHL1IQB4PZ&aff_sub4=Primary&utm_campaign=us-en-2c-mail-gro_dis-g_acq-mofu_free_beehiiv_test&utm_source=beehiiv.com&utm_medium=dis_ad&utm_term=&utm_ads=Concept2_Static1&_bhiiv=opp_66efed5d-877a-4fde-befc-46208eca691f_598ab766&bhcl_id=eff1b73c-dcd3-463e-bc68-0e882c36ae7f_{{subscriber_id}}_{{email_address_id}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Explore Proton’s benefits</a></p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span> JOBS</span></h2></div><div class="section"><p class="paragraph">✅ = Hiring partners who have passed our vetting process</p><h3 class="heading"><b>From our job board</b></h3><ul><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2558803?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Managing Director</a>, Movement Labs, Remote - US, $200,000-$250,000</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">✅ <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2463447?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Mid-Level Software Engineer</a>, Perpay, Philadelphia, PA, USA, $110,000-$150,000</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">✅ <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2236217?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Senior Software Engineer, Fullstack/Frontend/Backend</a>, Perpay, Philadelphia, PA, USA, $160,000-$220,000</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2574644?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Principal Software Engineer</a>, Imagine Pediatrics, Remote - United States, $200,000-$220,000</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2574643?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Staff Software Engineer</a>, Imagine Pediatrics, Remote - United States, $180,000-$200,000</p></li></ul><h3 class="heading"><b>From around the web</b></h3><p class="paragraph">Data</p><ul><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://careers.caresource.com/job/united-states/data-scientist-i/51136/101414333360?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Data Scientist I</a>, CareSource, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/fetch/jobs/4433775009?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Business Intelligence Analyst</a>, Fetch, Remote</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/truebill/jobs/7764054003?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Data Analyst, Growth Marketing</a>, Rocket Money, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://www.samsara.com/company/careers/roles/8141959?gh_jid=8141959&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Data Engineer</a>, Samsara, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/zestai/jobs/6217526004?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Data Scientist</a>, Zest AI, Remote</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph">Design</p><ul><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://app.dover.com/apply/point.me/5052ec51-43cb-432e-9ab0-78150e07cddd?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Product Designer</a>, point.me, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://jobs.rxnt.com/en/postings/aa71ae0e-e161-451e-8ee2-f143ff1fdd74?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Product Designer</a>, RXNT, Remote - US</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph">Software Engineering</p><ul><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://alkami.wd12.myworkdayjobs.com/en-US/Alkami/job/US-Remote/Software-Engineer--MANTL-_JR-000780-1?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer (MANTL)</a>, Alkami , Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://www.atlassian.com/company/careers/details/25539?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Backend Software Engineer</a>, Atlassian, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://resend.com/careers/2e3d92c5-79d9-4511-8faf-e2326e7a081e?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer, Developer Tools</a>, Resend , Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/truebill/jobs/7984901003?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Full Stack Engineer, Autopilot</a>, Rocket Money, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/truebill/jobs/8013696003?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer, Design Systems</a>, Rocket Money, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/vivosenseinc/jobs/4426699009?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer in Test</a>, VivoSense, Remote - US</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph"><span><i>Have any jobs you’d like us to share in our newsletter? Post </i></span><span><i><a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/post?from=PN&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">here</a></i></span><span><i>!</i></span></p></div><div class="section"><p class="paragraph"><b>Looking for internships and entry-level roles?</b></p><p class="paragraph">Our Early-talent newsletter will be most relevant to you! We share entry-level roles, internships and apprenticeships every Sunday.<br><a class="link" href="https://early-talent.diversifytech.com/subscribe?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Join our Early Talent Newsletter</a>!</p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span>EVENTS</span></h2></div><div class="section"><ul><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 15 - 17 <a class="link" href="https://conference.aises.org/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">AISES National Conference</a>, Portland, OR</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 17 <a class="link" href="https://princeton.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_pf7HHwBHR1-xkvnaTReEgg?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408#/registration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">A People&#39;s Academy — Thinking Freely Together with Ruha Benjamin</a></p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 17 <a class="link" href="https://dayofdata.org/2026-10-17-dayofdata1161/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Data of Day Orlando 2026</a>, Sanford, FL</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 17 - 18 <a class="link" href="https://techworkerscoalition.org/circuit-breakers/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Circuit Breakers &#39;26</a>, New York City</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 18 <a class="link" href="https://pybay.org/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">PyBay </a>, San Francisco, CA</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 19 <a class="link" href="https://actionnetwork.org/forms/ai-now-mpu-webster-hall?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">The People&#39;s AI Assembly</a>, Online and NYC</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 20 <a class="link" href="https://www.meetup.com/refactr-tech/events/315992186/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Open Source Night</a>, Atlanta, GA</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 24 <a class="link" href="https://sqlsaturday.com/2026-10-24-sqlsaturday1153/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">SQL Saturday Minnesota 2026</a>, Saint Paul, MN</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 26 - 29 <a class="link" href="https://2026.usa.jcon.one/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">JCON USA 2026 at IBM TechXchange</a>, Atlanta, GA</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 29 <a class="link" href="https://luma.com/05z8y8xs?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Responsible Tech Summit 2026. From Principles to Power: Embedding Accountability in the AI Era</a>, New York</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph"><span><i>Have a free or low-cost tech event to share in our newsletter? Add it </i></span><span><i><a class="link" href="https://form.jotform.com/252994841522060?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">here</a></i></span><span><i>!</i></span></p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span>SPEAK</span></h2></div><div class="section"><ul><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 6 - 11 <a class="link" href="https://aiconusa.techwell.com/speak-ai-con-usa?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">AI Con USA</a> in Seattle, WA, & Online. Apply by Oct 18.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Mar 22 - 25 <a class="link" href="https://sessionize.com/drupalcon-orlando2027/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">DrupalCon Orlando</a> in Orlando, FL. Apply by Oct 20.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Apr 16 <a class="link" href="https://sessionize.com/digital-crafts-day-2027?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Digital Crafts Day</a> in Weiden in der Oberpfalz, Germany. Apply by Oct 31.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Apr 1 - 4 <a class="link" href="https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/24x/cfp?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">SCaLE</a> in Pasadena, CA. Apply by Nov 1.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Apr 1 - 4 <a class="link" href="https://www.socallinuxexpo.org/scale/24x/cfp?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Southern California Linux Expo SCaLE USA 2027</a> in Pasadena, CA. Apply by Nov 1.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 14 - 16 <a class="link" href="https://sessionize.com/ila-8th-women-and-leadership-conference/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">ILA Women and Leadership Conference USA 2027</a> in St. Paul, MN. Apply by Nov 13.</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph"><span><i>Have a CFP to share in our newsletter? Add it </i></span><span><i><a class="link" href="https://form.jotform.com/252994841522060?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">here</a></i></span><span><i>!</i></span></p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span>RESOURCES</span></h2></div><div class="section"><ul><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://stephaniewalter.design/blog/neurodiversity-and-ux-essential-resources-for-cognitive-accessibility/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Neurodiversity and UX: Essential Resources for Cognitive Accessibility</a> by Stéphanie Walter: Guidelines to understand and design for Dyslexia, Dyscalculia, Autism and ADHD.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://www.rollingstone.com/culture/culture-features/women-warnings-ai-danger-risk-before-chatgpt-1234804367/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">These Women Tried to Warn Us About AI</a>: Today the risks of artificial intelligence are clear but the warning signs have been there all along.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/api-authentication-authorization-mechanisms-trade-offs-and-failure-modes/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">API Authentication & Authorization</a> by Oluwaseyi Fatunmole: An Engineering Deep Dive into Mechanisms, Trade-offs, and Failure Modes</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://chrisburnell.com/html-can-do-that/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-408" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">HTML Can Do That</a>: HTML has been gobbling up swathes of what used to be JavaScript’s remit. This article lists dynamic functionality that we can now achieve with just HTML.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class='beehiiv__footer'><br class='beehiiv__footer__break'><hr class='beehiiv__footer__line'><a target="_blank" class="beehiiv__footer_link" href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F775de5eb-ce85-483f-9bff-95d9329eb9bc%2Flogo_orig.png%3Fv%3D1792523268&publication_name=Diversify+Tech+-+Professional+Edition&utm_campaign=2115f3d2-7d1a-4d90-ba88-c904366f5557&utm_medium=post_rss&utm_source=diversify_tech_professional_edition">Powered by beehiiv</a></div></div>
  ]]></content:encoded>
