    <dc:creator>Veni Kunche</dc:creator>
  <content:encoded><![CDATA[
    <div class='beehiiv'><style>
  .bh__table, .bh__table_header, .bh__table_cell { border: 1px solid #C0C0C0; }
  .bh__table_cell { padding: 5px; background-color: #FFFFFF; }
  .bh__table_cell p { color: #2D2D2D; font-family: 'Helvetica',Arial,sans-serif !important; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
  .bh__table_header { padding: 5px; background-color:#F1F1F1; }
  .bh__table_header p { color: #2A2A2A; font-family:'Trebuchet MS','Lucida Grande',Tahoma,sans-serif !important; overflow-wrap: break-word; }
</style><div class='beehiiv__body'><p class="paragraph"></p><div class="section"><div class="image"><a class="image__link" href="https://diversifytech.com/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="" class="image__image" src="https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,format=auto,onerror=redirect,quality=80/uploads/asset/file/b49716c5-0bc0-4179-9d2f-c24c10f69d9f/Newsletter_Headings__1_.png"/></a></div><p class="paragraph"><span>Hi! Welcome to Diversify Tech&#39;s Professional Edition. This newsletter is for underrepresented people in tech; </span><span>specifically curated for mid-senior level folks.</span><span> Every Tuesday, we share jobs, events, and other career opportunities.</span></p><p class="paragraph"><b>In this week&#39;s issue,</b><br>💼 Edmunds, Dick’s Sporting Goods Habitat Health and more are hiring<br>📆 Power To Fly is hosting Pride: Championing LGBTQIA+ Leaders and Allies<br>⭐️ Black Code Collective is celebrating 10 years and seeking donations to help the community keep growing.</p><p class="paragraph">Cheers,<br>Veni Kunche</p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span> JOBS</span></h2></div><div class="section"><p class="paragraph">✅ = Hiring partners who have passed our vetting process</p><h3 class="heading"><b>From our job board</b></h3><ul><li><p class="paragraph">✅ <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2348362?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Senior Product Manager</a>, Basta, NYC preferred. The ability to travel to NYC 4-6 times/year, required, $150,000-$189,000</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">✅ <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2348361?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Director of Data Strategy</a>, Basta, NYC preferred. The ability to travel to NYC 4-6 times/year, required, $130,000-$163,000</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">✅ <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2330842?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer (AI Systems)</a>, EdReports, Remote - United States, $119,978-$179,970</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2272956?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Staff Software Engineer</a>, ActBlue, Remote - Must be located within the United States, $191,681-$241,452</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">✅ <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2271868?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">AI Science Advisor (California Department of Technology / Governor&#39;s Office of Emergency Services)</a>, California Council on Science and Technology (CCST), Sacramento, CA, $190,000-$220,000</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">✅ <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2325729?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Staff SDET</a>, Murmuration, Remote - United States, $225,324-$225,324</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">✅ <a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/job/2304956?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Product Engineer</a>, One Project, Remote - USA, East Coast time zone strongly preferred, $175,000-$200,000</p></li></ul><h3 class="heading"><b>From around the web</b></h3><p class="paragraph"><b>Data</b></p><ul><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://careers.jobscore.com/careers/edmunds/jobs/data-engineer-afc0J-9aXmBi32Rh6AEAhs?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Data Engineer</a>, Edmunds , Remote </p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/habitathealth/jobs/5221343008?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Sr. Data Analyst, Reporting</a>, Habitat Health, Remote, USA</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://one10llc.wd108.myworkdayjobs.com/en-US/ONE10/job/Data-Scientist_R100052?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Data Scientist</a>, One10, Remote</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph"><b>Design</b></p><ul><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://jobs.ashbyhq.com/finch/3ecb9486-04a5-4afc-82c0-44255ed441fd?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Product Designer</a>, Finch, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://hwmedia.bamboohr.com/careers/43?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">UI/UX Designer</a>, HousingWire , Remote</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://apply.workable.com/irth-solutions/j/D4946545AF/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">UX-UI Designer</a>, Irth, Remote - US & Canada</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/capitalrx/jobs/5205521008?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">UX/UI Designer</a>, Judi Health, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://job-boards.greenhouse.io/life360/jobs/8553069002?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Principal Product Designer, Devices</a>, Life360, Remote, USA; Remote, Canada</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://zoicstudios.applytojob.com/apply/wWwTksFgyb/US-UIUX-Designer-Zoic-Labs?source=Our+Career+Page+Widget&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">UI/UX Designer</a>, Zoic Labs, Remote - US</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph"><b>Software Engineering</b></p><ul><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://ats.rippling.com/boompop/jobs/13e4495b-110e-43a7-8fdf-c1551bee8c4e?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer</a>, BoomPop, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://jobs.lever.co/corbalt/3ab33940-c0bf-4577-a203-5cf88ff787d2?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer</a>, Corbalt , Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://www.dickssportinggoods.jobs/job/software-engineer-ii-merchandising/remote/202606689/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer II - Merchandising</a>, DICK&#39;S Sporting Goods, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://careers.jobscore.com/careers/edmunds/jobs/software-engineer-aUbMVbMULePOMaM1RFoazn?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer</a>, Edmunds, Remote</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://hstpathways.applytojob.com/apply/jobs/details/A9D3f5ZRnA?=&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer</a>, HST Pathways, Remote - US</p></li><li><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://www.preludesecurity.com/company/careers?ashby_jid=b498f9f5-d4ec-4948-be68-6019f309f738&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389#roles" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Software Engineer</a>, Prelude, Remote - US</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph"><span><i>Have any jobs you’d like us to share in our newsletter? Post </i></span><span><i><a class="link" href="https://jobs.diversifytech.com/post?from=PN&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">here</a></i></span><span><i>!</i></span></p></div><div class="section"><p class="paragraph"><b>Looking for internships and entry-level roles?</b></p><p class="paragraph">Our Early-talent newsletter will be most relevant to you! We share entry-level roles, internships and apprenticeships every Sunday.<br><a class="link" href="https://early-talent.diversifytech.com/subscribe?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Join our Early Talent Newsletter</a>!</p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span>EVENTS</span></h2></div><div class="section"><ul><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 2 - 4 <a class="link" href="https://womenwhocode.com/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">WWCode Summit</a>, New York</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 4 - 5 <a class="link" href="https://2026.pg-data.org/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">PG DATA CONFERENCE 2026</a>, Chicago, IL</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 4 <a class="link" href="https://luma.com/lsbq4ggj?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Women in Tech Collective</a>, New York</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 10 <a class="link" href="https://www.meetup.com/dbavug/events/312760881?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Optimized Locking: Improving SQL Server Transaction Concurrency ~ Deborah M.</a>, Online </p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 10 <a class="link" href="https://www.eventbrite.com/e/rxt-reproductive-justice-in-the-digital-age-tickets-1988885223242?aff=oddtdtcreator&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">RightsxTech: Reproductive Justice in the Digital Age</a>, Online</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 16 <a class="link" href="https://www.meetup.com/dba-fundamentals-group/events/314400365?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Critical DBA Tasks for Postgresql - Pat Wright</a>, Online </p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 16 <a class="link" href="https://www.meetup.com/torontoai/events/314685467?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Build Your First AWS Data Lake in 60 Minutes — Live, with Real Code</a>, Online</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 18 <a class="link" href="https://www.meetup.com/python-stlouis/events/313870807/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Python for (Almost) Everything</a>, Saint Louis, MO</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 18 <a class="link" href="https://aspeninstitute.zoom.us/webinar/register/WN_OS6zG5cbR4aaT2EreRBBOw?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389#/registration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Scam Fighters Workshop</a>, Online</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 24 - 25 <a class="link" href="https://powertofly.com/events/summit/pride-2026?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Pride: Championing LGBTQIA+ Leaders and Allies</a>, Online</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 24 <a class="link" href="https://sjsu.zoom.us/meeting/register/8WOpS_cMQ0aCXl82vO_iVw?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389#/registration" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">CoT Book Club: Techno-negative: A Long History of Refusing the Machine</a>, Online</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 24 <a class="link" href="https://www.midwestcommunityday.com/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">AWS Community Day Midwest 2026</a>, Indianapolis, IN, USA</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph"><span><i>Have a free or low-cost tech event to share in our newsletter? Add it </i></span><span><i><a class="link" href="https://form.jotform.com/252994841522060?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">here</a></i></span><span><i>!</i></span></p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span>SPEAK</span></h2></div><div class="section"><ul><li><p class="paragraph">Oct 1 <a class="link" href="https://opentechday.de/propose/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Open Tech Day 2026 </a> in Nuremberg, Germany. Apply by May 31.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Aug 6 - 7 <a class="link" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfRZvTvlUEfmCSvSCZeYMVNwW2hwIXoadyV20B-VrRKYugn3w/viewform?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Civics of Technology Online Conference </a> (Virtual). Apply by Jun 14.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Nov 3 - 24 <a class="link" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd_-J9Ui7hg24lgTO_jsSXsDKFQfAxSRr4aXJ1Na8oXRfIHbQ/viewform?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">XtremeJS-2026</a> (Virtual). Apply by Jul 10.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Nov 10 <a class="link" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd_-J9Ui7hg24lgTO_jsSXsDKFQfAxSRr4aXJ1Na8oXRfIHbQ/viewform?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">XtremeJS-2026</a> (Virtual). Apply by Jul 10.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Nov 3 - 24 <a class="link" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd_-J9Ui7hg24lgTO_jsSXsDKFQfAxSRr4aXJ1Na8oXRfIHbQ/viewform?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">XtremeJS-2026</a> (Virtual). Apply by Jul 10.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Aug 7 - 8 <a class="link" href="https://sessionize.com/bsides-brighton/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">BSides Brighton-2026</a> in United Kingdom. Apply by Jul 31.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">May 27 <a class="link" href="https://sessionize.com/jnation-2026/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">JNation 2026</a> in Coimbra, Portugal.</p></li><li><p class="paragraph">Jun 12 - 16 <a class="link" href="https://gitnation.com/login?return-to=%2Fevents%2Freact-summit-2026%2Fcfp&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">React Summit</a> in Amsterdam.</p></li></ul><p class="paragraph"><span><i>Have a CFP to share in our newsletter? Add it </i></span><span><i><a class="link" href="https://form.jotform.com/252994841522060?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">here</a></i></span><span><i>!</i></span></p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span>RESOURCES & ARTICLES</span></h2></div><div class="section"><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.06806?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Big AI&#39;s Regulatory Capture: Mapping Industry Interference and Government Complicity</a><br>Abeba Birhane and co-authors examine how tech companies employ a wide variety of tactics: from disregarding or misinterpreting existing laws; claiming regulation stifles innovation and unfairly prevents people from accessing AI products; lobbying; to private meetings with regulators to ensure that regulation remains favourable.</p><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://css-tricks.com/technical-writing-in-the-ai-age/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Technical Writing in the AI Age</a><br>Geoff Graham shares thoughts on technical writing in the age of AI, including advice on finding your place, leaning into real-life experiences, citing generously, learning fast and sharing often.</p><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://www.freecodecamp.org/news/how-to-avoid-rebuilding-infrastructure-for-every-new-project/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">How to Avoid Rebuilding Infrastructure for Every New Project</a><br>Manish Shivanandhan examines why production teams waste time rebuilding the same infrastructure for every new project and how Platform as a Service can help.</p><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://labor.dair-institute.org/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Luddite Lab Resource Hub</a> <br>The Distributed AI Research Institute has launched the Luddite Lab Resource Hub. It provides resources for unions, labor organizations, and worker-organizers fighting AI and automation at work</p><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://cassidoo.co/post/clustering-tiles/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">A Simple Clustering Algorithm for Lists</a><br>Cassidy Williams shares a heuristic algorithm she developed while sorting her toddler&#39;s Magna-Tiles.</p><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://www.techpolicy.press/when-government-algorithms-quietly-become-rules/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">When Government Algorithms Quietly Become Rules</a><br>Eli Talbert discusses how mandatory digital systems used by federal agencies can shape enforcement outcomes through design choices rather than formal rules, raising concerns about transparency and judicial review.</p><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://19thnews.org/2026/04/minnesota-nudification-ban-ai-deepfake/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Minnesota Passes the Nation&#39;s First Ban on &#39;Nudification&#39; Apps</a><br>Jasmine Mithani reports on the Minnesota Senate passing the country&#39;s first ban on &quot;nudification&quot; apps 65-0, addressing one of the main sources of nonconsensual deepfakes.</p></div><div class="section"><h2 class="heading"><span><span>COMMUNITY CORNER</span></span></h2></div><div class="section"><p class="paragraph"><a class="link" href="https://blackcodecollective.com/?utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow">Black Code Collective</a> is a community built for Black software developers to sharpen their skills, exchange knowledge, and lift each other up. As they celebrate 10 years, they are raising $10K to fund yearly operating costs, food at meetups, and the continued growth of the community.</p><div class="button"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow noreferrer" class="button__link" href="https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=8EMU7QWDLGXX6&utm_source=newsletter.diversifytech.com&utm_medium=newsletter&utm_campaign=diversify-tech-389"><span class="button__text"> Donate today! </span></a></div></div></div><div class='beehiiv__footer'><br class='beehiiv__footer__break'><hr class='beehiiv__footer__line'><a target="_blank" class="beehiiv__footer_link" href="https://www.beehiiv.com/powered-by?publication_logo=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.beehiiv.com%2Fcdn-cgi%2Fimage%2Ffit%3Dscale-down%2Cformat%3Dauto%2Conerror%3Dredirect%2Cquality%3D80%2Fuploads%2Fpublication%2Flogo%2F775de5eb-ce85-483f-9bff-95d9329eb9bc%2Flogo_orig.png%3Fv%3D1792523268&publication_name=Diversify+Tech+-+Professional+Edition&utm_campaign=cc277558-eab4-489d-aaba-d1f006b9fc66&utm_medium=post_rss&utm_source=diversify_tech_professional_edition">Powered by beehiiv</a></div></div>
